text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text I am walking down the hallway by myself.
text *Tap* *Tap* *Tap* *Tap*
text @[Tomoya]
text *Sigh*
text I'm holding a school bag.
text It's after school, so it's not really a problem...
text *Tap* *Tap* *Tap* *Tap*
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text I stop to look behind me, and far away, Kyou is there.
text She's holding her hip, and staring at me.
text Grudgingly, I start walking again.
text *Tap* *Tap* *Tap* *Tap*
text @[Tomoya]
text *Sigh*
text I can't help but keep sighing.
text Even though the school bag in my hand is quite thin, it feels awfully heavy.
text It's been a while since I've gone home so melancholically.
text @[Tomoya]
text I sure don't learn, huh...
text I shake my head, as if tormenting myself for my foolishness.
text This already happened once just yesterday...
text @[Tomoya]
text The front gate, huh...?
text I say my destination out loud, and my shoulder stoops.
text At this point, I can't even sigh anymore.
