text I wasted about half an hour in the barren courtyard.
text There are no signs of anyone on campus.
text I can faintly hear the sounds of the sports clubs working their butts off coming from the fields on the other side of the school building.
text To be honest, it's a huge bother.
text We've only been in the same class for a short while, and here she is, trying to pair the two of us together.
text Besides, is that even something a sister would normally do?
text She's being far too overprotective. Geez.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...I guess it's about time...
text I stand up from the stone fence as I stay alert to my surroundings.
text At that moment...!
