text Under the sunset, the asphalt turns dark violet.
text It's still the at the point in the season where it gets cold once the sun sets.
text A cool breeze blows by, bringing with it the scent of the evening.
text Within it, two long shadows continue to move at a steady pace.
text One of which belongs to me, and the other to Fujibayashi.
